Step of 1.3 m. Actual value = field value * 1.3.""" ;
            sh:maxCount 1 ;
            sh:path ntn3gpp:PositionVelocity.positionZ ],
        [ sh:datatype xsd:int ;
            sh:description """X, Y, Z coordinate of satellite velocity state vector
