Step of 0.06 m/s. Actual value = field value * 0.06.""" ;
            sh:maxCount 1 ;
            sh:path ntn3gpp:PositionVelocity.velocityVX ],
        [ sh:datatype xsd:int ;
            sh:description """X, Y, Z coordinate of satellite velocity state vector
